    "Indico 沒有開放報到權限" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check-in is not enabled on Indico"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logo 以世學聯兩大主色為起點：象徵美麗海島的海洋藍台灣黑熊，承載著遊子對土地的連結；深紅的獅頭則代表新加坡，也象徵台灣留學生在海外奮鬥的精神。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The logo takes WWTSA's two colours as its starting point: an ocean-blue Formosan black bear for the island itself and the tie students keep to it, and a deep red lion's head for Singapore and the determination of studying far from home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
