    },
    "伺服器錯誤 %lld。%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Server error %1$lld. %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你剛才已經自己登入過活動網站，所以不是「別人還登著」的問題。你手上那個活動網站帳號，**登記的信箱和 App 不同**。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You have just signed in to the event site yourself, so this is not somebody else’s session left open. The event-site account you signed in with **has a different email address from the app**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你沒有這場活動的報到權限。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You do not have check-in permission for this event."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的活動網站帳號登記的是 %@，與這裡的 STSA 帳號不同。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your event-site account is registered as %@, which is not the STSA account signed in here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 %@ 解鎖" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
