    },
    "優惠" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "優惠網頁" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offers page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全世界各地的大學都有台灣學生會（TSA）。在各個國家，TSA 能夠從當地台北辦事處得到第一手的資源，台灣留學生則可透過 TSA 獲得許多協助，更快熟悉陌生環境，並建立彼此互助的管道。我們希望把 TSA 的制度帶進新加坡，但因當地政策，學校無法成立以「國家」或「族群」為交流目的的學生會或社團。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Universities around the world have Taiwanese Student Associations. In most countries a TSA works directly with the local Taipei Representative Office, giving Taiwanese students a first point of contact, a faster route to settling in, and a network to lean on. We wanted to bring that to Singapore — but local policy prevents universities from recognising student societies formed around a nationality or ethnicity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全體公告" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All members"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "兩邊的名字一樣，所以這多半是**同一個人的兩個地址**：其中一邊登記的信箱是舊的。這個沒辦法靠重新登入解決，需要有人去改。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The names match, so this is most likely **one person with two addresses** — one side is registered with an old one. Signing in again will not fix it; somebody has to change it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公告" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
