    "最可能是什麼" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What this usually is"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最常見的原因是**這支手機的瀏覽器還留著別人的活動網站登入**。如果上面「活動網站」那個名字你不認得，按它下面的按鈕重新登入就會恢復。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The usual cause is **somebody else’s event-site session still open in this phone’s browser**. If the name shown under “Event site” is not one you recognise, sign in again with the button below it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出示 STSA 電子會員卡" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show your STSA member card"
