    "出示會員卡" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show member card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出示此卡以參加會員活動、領取新生包,或在合作商家享有折扣。畫面會自動調亮以便掃描。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show this card at member events, to collect your welcome pack, or for partner discounts. The screen brightens automatically so it scans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出示電子會員卡即可享有以下合作品牌的專屬禮遇。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
