    "只會重新登入活動網站，不影響 App。如果你在活動網站上還沒有帳號，它會先請你填姓名建立個人資料；完成後若沒有自動回到 App，關掉視窗再按一次就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This signs in to the event site only — the app is untouched. If you do not have an event-site account yet, it will ask for your name first. If it does not return to the app afterwards, close the window and tap again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
